    dct:description "Evaluates only 2 hardcoded parameter sets (`J_LD=11` sorting vs `J=10` control) without a continuous sweep across `J_LD` (or `gamma_LD`), without mapping temperature regimes (`T = 0` pinning arrest, `T = 10` optimal sorting, `T = 80` thermal melting), and without CLI parameter flags (`main`, L257-266)." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-parameter-expressivity> ;
